		(property "Notes" "Front-cell NTC, SMD on B.Cu in the outer bottom corner of the gap-filler zone over C4 (BT104), outboard of the BQ25756 (under the gel; research_notes/Pack thermal BAK 65E/smd-ntc.md). Reads the board there, 0.6-3.8 K above the hottest point of the C4 (BT104) can in the model. Keep the inner planes under it; low side to CELL_1N by its own trace. Gauge internal 18k pull-up; enable TS4 in data flash. Murata NCP15XH103F03RB/RC: B25/50 = 3380 K, B25/85 = 3435 K"
